WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:07.940
Hey, it's arkinox with some more helpful Cyberspace tips.

00:08.440 --> 00:11.480
Did you know that you don't need an account to sign up for Cyberspace?

00:12.300 --> 00:14.900
When you visit onosendai.tech for the first time,

00:14.900 --> 00:17.200
it generates what's called a private key,

00:17.660 --> 00:18.660
and that's your identity.

00:19.480 --> 00:22.480
A private key is just a really, really big number,

00:22.740 --> 00:24.560
so big that you can't fathom it,

00:24.780 --> 00:29.820
and it's so unique that it can serve as your identity across the entire universe.

00:29.820 --> 00:33.540
Everything that you do in Cyberspace is signed by that private key,

00:34.060 --> 00:36.340
so it's all verifiably your data,

00:36.700 --> 00:38.360
and I don't own any of it,

00:38.400 --> 00:41.380
and I can't change any of it, and that's why Cyberspace works.

00:41.960 --> 00:44.060
So go ahead and head on over to onosendai.tech,

00:44.600 --> 00:47.580
generate your first key, and start changing the world.
